        "text": {
            "description_html": "<b>Emtek AP-86910, Blythe Appliance Pull</b>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\nThe Blythe Refrigerator Handle has a traditional appearance that has long been a classic for its unassuming grace. This Blythe Appliance Pull is available in several beautiful finish colors including matte black, polished chrome, and satin brass. We picture it to the right in oil rubbed bronze because we adore the way the natural highlights of that finish accent the pull so beautifully. The Transitional Heritage Blythe Appliance Pull is available in either 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. Add warmth to your kitchen appliances with this refrigerator pull. \r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Specifications</b> of the Emtek Blythe Appliance Handle:\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Material: Brass</li>\r\n<li>Pull Mounting: Standard 3/4\" Thick Appliance Panel</li>\r\n<li><a href=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-86910-specifications.pdf?v=1704262368\"><b>Emtek Blythe Pull Dimensions Diagram (PDF)</b></a></li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<b>Available in 2 Sizes:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86910:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 12-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 12\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n<br>\r\n<b>EMT-AP-86911:</b>\r\n<ul>\r\n<li>Total Length: 18-1/2\"</li>\r\n<li>Center to Center Length: 18\"</li>\r\n<li>Pull Handle Width: 13/16\"</li>\r\n<li>Total Projection: 2\"</li>\r\n<li>Base: 1\"</li>\r\n</ul>\r\n</ul>\r\n</p>\r\n\r\n<p>\r\n<img src=\"https://cdn.shopify.com/s/files/1/0766/1489/3857/files/EMT-modern-5-Finishes.jpg?v=1704354501\" width=\"511\" height=\"111\" border=\"0\" alt=\"Emtek Finish Chart\">\r\n</p>",
            "seo": {
                "title": "Blythe Refrigerator Handle",
                "description": "The Blythe Refrigerator Handle has a traditional appearance that has long been a classic for its unassuming grace. This Blythe Appliance Pull is available in several beautiful finish colors including matte black, polished chrome, and satin brass. We picture it to the right in oil rubbed bronze because we adore the way the natural highlights of that finish accent the pull so beautifully. The Transitional Heritage Blythe Appliance Pull is available in either 12 inch or 18 inch center to center lengths. Add warmth to your kitchen appliances with this refrigerator pull. \r\n",
